WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
Hello, my name is Scott,
and I am your program manager.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.590
I will be here to support and guide you
throughout your externship.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:14.220
You can think of me as your manager
and a facilitator for the program.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.240
I'll be your day-to-day contact, and you can
expect for me to provide guidance on how to

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.880
work through your projects. I can answer
any questions you have throughout

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:26.090
the externship, and I'll also help facilitate
your interactions with the host

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:30.770
company through our live meeting, where you'll
be able to introduce yourself, engage

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:35.980
in Q&A and, most excitingly,
showcase your work to real-world company

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:41.040
leaders. Generally, I'm here to ensure that
you feel supported as you gain real

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:46.560
work experience and practical skills that you
will be taking with you into your future career path.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.400
I'm really looking forward to working with you
and encourage you to please

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.680
reach out early and often via Slack
throughout the experience to ensure that

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.160
we can connect and that you make
the most out of this experience.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.600
Looking forward to seeing you soon. Take care.
